# Evil at the Inlet (crystalWar 21, call-only): a level 99 Warrior in Crawlers' Nest [S] with the Bronze Ribbon of
# Service (missions as group 1's flows). Rodeupansat 107, finished: the quest added, the Evil-warding Seal; again: 108.
# Vunkerl Inlet [S]: qm6 112, finished: the seal taken; again: its script's NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. Crawlers' Nest
# [S]: Rodeupansat 109, finished: completed (the Scroll of Recall-Jugner); again: 110.
lists CrawlersNestS/Rodeupansat/onTrigger VunkerlInletS/qm6/onTrigger CrawlersNestS/onEventFinish/107 CrawlersNestS/onEventFinish/109 VunkerlInletS/onEventFinish/112
char zone=CrawlersNestS pos=130.74,-34.353,25.927 job=WAR lvl=99
keyitem BronzeRibbonOfService
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Rodeupansat                     # available, the ribbon, level 30+: 107
finish                                  # the quest added; the Evil-warding Seal
trigger Rodeupansat                     # accepted, the seal: 108
finish
warp -633.885,-51.101,-454.311 VunkerlInletS
trigger qm6                             # accepted, the seal: 112
finish                                  # the seal taken
trigger qm6                             # no seal: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 130.74,-34.353,25.927 CrawlersNestS
trigger Rodeupansat                     # accepted, no seal: 109
finish                                  # completed (the Scroll of Recall-Jugner)
trigger Rodeupansat                     # completed: 110
finish
